{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "f2c002aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 650,
      "label": "Boundary values and information loss · 边界值与信息丢失"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1c001aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 650,
      "label": "Geometry of constraints · 约束的几何"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 1660,
      "label": "空间语言",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000002",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 6600,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 800,
      "label": "方程组解结构",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000003",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 7900,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 1210,
      "label": "矩阵乘积与秩",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000004",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 3800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2600,
      "height": 1800,
      "label": "消元与求基",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000005",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 6600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 1530,
      "label": "秩与四空间",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000006",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 1200,
      "label": "逆矩阵与求逆",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "20000000000000ff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 9600,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# 线性方程组与四个基本子空间\n\n先建立空间、线性无关、张成、基与维数的语言，再把 $Ax=b$ 拆成列空间的可达性与零空间的唯一性。消元用主元、自由变量和 RREF 计算解并构造各空间的基；同一套行操作也能用 Gauss–Jordan 方法求逆。秩与四个基本子空间解释这些计算的整体结构，矩阵乘积则从 $Ax$ 延伸到多列与低秩结构。箭头的具体关系以标签为准：它可能表示前置、推出、分类或计算方法。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000032",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "## [[向量空间]]\n\n向量空间是允许加法和数乘、并满足线性运算公理的集合。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000018",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "## [[线性无关]]\n\n只有全零系数能组合出零向量，说明这组方向没有冗余。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000019",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "## [[张成]]\n\n一组向量的全部线性组合构成它们的张成；覆盖目标空间就是能够表示其中每个向量。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "## [[子空间]]\n\n子空间包含零向量，并对任意线性组合封闭。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[线性无关与张成|Independence and spanning]]\n\nIndependence gives at most one coefficient representation; spanning gives at least one for every target in the specified space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n线性无关保证至多一种系数表示；张成保证指定空间的每个目标至少有一种表示。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000044",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[子空间并集判据|When a union is a subspace]]\n\nFor two subspaces of the same vector space, the union is a subspace exactly when one contains the other.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同一向量空间内两个子空间的并仍为子空间，恰要求一方包含另一方。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[基]]\n\n一组基既线性无关又张成整个空间，是一套刚好够用的坐标方向。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000020",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 1400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[维数]]\n\n有限维空间任一组基所含向量的共同数目，就是这个空间的维数。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7140,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[零空间|Nullspace]]\n$N(A)=\\{x:Ax=0\\}$ is the input subspace erased by $A$, including zero. If $N(A)=\\{0\\}$, each attainable output has exactly one input.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**零空间**：$N(A)$ 是被映成零的全部输入，包含零向量。零空间只有零向量时，每个可达输出才有唯一输入。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7240,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Ax的列组合解释|Column combination]]\nFor an $m\\times n$ matrix $A=[a_1\\cdots a_n]$, $Ax=\\sum_{j=1}^n x_ja_j$. Input coordinate $x_j$ scales column $a_j$; adding gives one output with $m$ coordinates.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Ax的列组合解释**：输入坐标 $x_j$ 缩放第 $j$ 列，再相加得到一个含 $m$ 个坐标的输出。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6660,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[方程组解分类|Classify solutions]]\nIf $b\\notin C(A)$, there is no solution. If $b$ is attainable, a trivial kernel gives one solution and a nontrivial kernel gives multiple solutions, infinitely many over $\\mathbb R$ or $\\mathbb C$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**方程组解分类**：先判断目标是否可达，再判断零空间是否只有零向量。有解且零空间非平凡时有多个解；实数或复数域上为无穷多个。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6915,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[特解加零空间|Particular solution + nullspace]]\nIf $Ax_p=b$, every solution is exactly $x=x_p+z$ with $z\\in N(A)$. Subtract two solutions to get a zero-output difference; add any such difference to get another solution.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**特解加零空间**：有特解 $x_p$ 后，全部解就是 $x_p+N(A)$。当 $b\\ne0$ 时，这是平移的零空间，不是向量子空间。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵乘积逐列作用|Reading a product by columns]]\nFor compatible real or complex matrices, column $j$ of $AB$ is $Ab_j$, where $b_j$ is column $j$ of $B$. Entries of $b_j$ combine columns of $A$, so $C(AB)\\subseteq C(A)$. Containment can be strict.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**矩阵乘积逐列作用**：对尺寸匹配的实或复矩阵，$AB$ 第 $j$ 列是 $Ab_j$，$b_j$ 为 $B$ 第 $j$ 列。$b_j$ 的分量组合 $A$ 的各列，故 $C(AB)\\subseteq C(A)$；包含可能严格。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000045",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8500,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵乘积逐行作用|Reading a product by rows]]\nFor compatible real or complex matrices, row $i$ of $A$ supplies coefficients combining the rows of $B$ into row $i$ of $AB$. Hence $\\operatorname{Row}(AB)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Row}(B)$. This algebraic row span uses no conjugation.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**矩阵乘积逐行作用**：对尺寸匹配的实或复矩阵，$A$ 第 $i$ 行提供系数，组合 $B$ 的各行，得到 $AB$ 第 $i$ 行。因此 $\\operatorname{Row}(AB)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Row}(B)$；这里采用不取共轭的代数行张成。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000046",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8250,
      "y": 2280,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵乘积秩上界|Rank of a product]]\nFor compatible matrices over the same field, $\\operatorname{rank}(AB)\\le\\min\\{\\operatorname{rank}(A),\\operatorname{rank}(B)\\}$. Column and row containments give the two bounds. Equality can fail even when both factors are nonzero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**矩阵乘积秩上界**：同一数域上尺寸匹配时，乘积的秩不超过任一因子的秩。列、行空间包含分别给出两侧上界；两因子都非零，等号也可能不成立。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000029",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 2620,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵乘积外积展开|Outer-product expansion]]\nFor $A:m\\times n$ and $B:n\\times p$, pair column $k$ of $A$ with row $k$ of $B$ and sum the $n$ full $m\\times p$ contributions. Ordinary transpose does not conjugate. Nonzero terms can repeat directions or cancel.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**矩阵乘积外积展开**：将 $A$ 第 $k$ 列与 $B$ 第 $k$ 行配对，把 $n$ 个完整的 $m\\times p$ 贡献相加。普通转置不取共轭；非零项可重复方向或相互抵消。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8500,
      "y": 2620,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[秩一矩阵外积刻画|Rank-one matrices and outer products]]\nA matrix has rank one exactly when it is $uv^T$ with both vectors nonzero. Every column is a multiple of $u$; conversely, a nonzero column and the coefficients of all columns construct the factors. Zero factors give rank zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**秩一矩阵外积刻画**：矩阵秩为一，当且仅当它是两个非零向量的外积 $uv^T$。每列都是 $u$ 的倍数；反过来，选一条非零列并收集各列系数，即可构造因子。零因子给出秩零。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000031",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3860,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[初等矩阵|Elementary matrix]]\nOne reversible row operation on the identity $I_m$ gives an $m\\times m$ matrix $E$. For every $m\\times n$ matrix $A$, $EA$ performs that operation; $E^{-1}$ undoes it. A sequence is a product of elementary matrices.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**初等矩阵**：对单位矩阵 $I_m$ 作一次可逆行操作，得到 $m\\times m$ 初等矩阵 $E$。对任意 $m\\times n$ 矩阵 $A$，$EA$ 执行同一操作，$E^{-1}$ 撤销它；操作序列由初等矩阵的乘积记录。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4820,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[行操作的解集不变性|Solution preservation]]\nAn invertible row-operation record $E$ gives $Ax=b\\iff(EA)x=Eb$ for every candidate $x$. Transform both blocks of $[A\\mid b]$. The result also covers rectangular $A$, no solutions and many solutions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**行操作的解集不变性**：可逆行操作记录 $E$ 对每个候选 $x$ 都给出 $Ax=b\\iff(EA)x=Eb$。应同步变换 $[A\\mid b]$ 两块；矩形 $A$、无解和多解同样适用。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000042",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4320,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[行等价|Row equivalence]]\nTwo same-sized matrices over the same field are row equivalent if finitely many reversible row operations connect them. If their combined record is $E$ and $R=EA$, then $Ax=b$ becomes $Rx=Eb$, with the same solutions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**行等价**：同一数域上的同型矩阵能经有限次可逆行操作互相得到，就行等价。若合成记录为 $E$、$R=EA$，则 $Ax=b$ 应变为 $Rx=Eb$，解集保持不变。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000030",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5320,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[高斯消元|Gaussian elimination]]\nReversible operations on $[A\\mid b]$ produce echelon form. Swap in a nonzero pivot, or skip a column with no available pivot. Check consistency, then choose free coordinates and back-substitute.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**高斯消元**：对 $[A\\mid b]$ 作可逆操作得到阶梯形。必要时换入非零主元；没有可用主元的列就跳过。先检查相容性，再任取自由坐标并回代。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5360,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[消元与LU分解|Elimination and LU]]\nFor square $A$, record row permutations in $PA=LU$: $L$ is unit lower triangular and $U$ is upper triangular. Without exchanges, $P=I$. Later swaps must also move the previously stored multiplier prefixes in $L$. Invertible $A$ allows triangular solves $Ly=Pb$, then $Ux=y$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**消元与LU分解**：对方阵 $A$，用 $PA=LU$ 记录换行：$L$ 为单位下三角，$U$ 为上三角。不换行时 $P=I$；后续换行还须移动 $L$ 已保存的乘子前缀。$A$ 可逆时，先解 $Ly=Pb$，再解 $Ux=y$。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000024",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3860,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[行最简形|Reduced row echelon form]]\nZero rows are last. Each nonzero row has first nonzero entry $1$; these leading positions move strictly right down the rows, and every other entry in a leading column is zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**行最简形**：零行位于末尾；各非零行首个非零元为 $1$，位置逐行严格右移，且所在列其余元素全为零。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000047",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3860,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[RREF存在唯一性|Existence and uniqueness of RREF]]\nEvery finite matrix over a fixed field is row equivalent to exactly one RREF. Exact legal row operations may follow different paths, but their final reduced matrix is the same. Ordinary echelon forms need not be unique.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**RREF存在唯一性**：固定数域上的每个有限矩阵，都行等价于唯一的 RREF。精确合法行操作的路径可以不同，最终最简矩阵相同；普通阶梯形则未必唯一。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4510,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[主元与自由变量|Pivots and free coordinates]]\nWith $n$ coefficient columns and $r$ pivots, rank is $r$. If $Ax=b$ is consistent, its $n-r$ free coordinates determine all pivot coordinates. An augmented-column pivot signals inconsistency.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**主元与自由变量**：$n$ 个系数列中有 $r$ 个主元，秩即 $r$。系统相容时，$n-r$ 个自由坐标确定全部主元坐标；增广列出现主元则无解。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4510,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[RREF读取子空间基|Choose the basis route]]\nFor real $A$, invertible row operations give RREF $R=EA$: use original pivot columns for $C(A)$, nonzero rows of $R$ for the row space, solutions of $Rx=0$ for $N(A)$, and transpose rows of $E$ corresponding to zero rows of $R$ for the left nullspace.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**RREF读取子空间基**：实矩阵 $A$ 经可逆行操作化为 $R=EA$：列基取原主元列，行基取 $R$ 非零行，零空间基解 $Rx=0$，左零基取 $E$ 中对应 $R$ 零行的记录行并转置。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000025",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3860,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[RREF读取列空间基|Column bases from pivot indices]]\nCompute the RREF $R$ of $A$ using invertible row operations. Find its pivot column indices, then take those columns from $A$. The reduced columns can span a different output space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**RREF读取列空间基**：可逆行操作把 $A$ 化为行最简形 $R$。用 $R$ 找主元列编号，再回到原矩阵 $A$ 取这些列作为基；不能一般地直接抄化简后的列，它们张成的输出空间可能已改变。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000026",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4480,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[RREF读取行空间基|Row bases from nonzero rows]]\nInvertible row operations preserve the span of the rows. The nonzero rows of the RREF are independent and form a basis for that same row space. For a zero matrix, the basis is empty.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**RREF读取行空间基**：可逆行操作保持行的张成；行最简形的非零行又线性无关，所以直接构成原行空间的一组基。零矩阵使用空基，行空间仍为 $\\{0\\}$。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000027",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5100,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[RREF读取零空间基|Build a nullspace basis]]\nInvertible row operations give $N(A)=N(R)$. In $Rx=0$, set each free coordinate in turn to $1$, the others to $0$, and solve for every pivot coordinate. The full vectors form a basis; with no free coordinates, use the empty basis.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**RREF读取零空间基**：可逆行操作保持零空间。解 $Rx=0$ 时，逐个自由坐标取 $1$、其余取 $0$，再求全部主元坐标；这些完整向量构成基。没有自由坐标时，基为空。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000028",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5720,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[消元追踪左零空间基|Track a left-nullspace basis]]\nFor real $m\\times n$ $A$, record $[A\\mid I_m]\\to[R\\mid E]$, with $EA=R$. Transpose the rows of $E$ matching zero rows of $R$ to obtain a basis of $N(A^T)$. For the complex space $N(A^*)$, use conjugate transpose instead.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**消元追踪左零空间基**：实矩阵 $A$ 为 $m\\times n$ 时，用 $m\\times m$ 单位块记录消元。取 $R$ 零行对应的 $E$ 行并转置，得到原左零空间基；复数 $N(A^*)$ 则须共轭转置。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000036",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4360,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[主元|Pivot]]\nA pivot is the first nonzero entry of a nonzero row in echelon form. Its value need not be $1$; RREF normalizes it to $1$. Count coefficient pivots, not an augmented-column pivot, when identifying unknowns.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**主元**：阶梯形中，非零行的首个非零元是主元。其值不必为 $1$，RREF 才把它归一。识别未知量时应看系数列主元，不能把增广列主元当成一个未知量。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000037",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4860,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[自由变量|Free variable]]\nIn a consistent system, unknowns in nonpivot coefficient columns may be chosen arbitrarily; back-substitution determines the pivot unknowns. A nonpivot column need not be zero. The right-hand side is not an unknown.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**自由变量**：系统相容时，非主元系数列对应的未知量可任取，主元未知量由回代确定。非主元列不必是零列；右端列不对应未知量。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000038",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5800,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[置换矩阵|Permutation matrix]]\nRearranging the rows of $I_n$ gives $P$: one $1$ in each row and column, zeros elsewhere. $PA$ reorders rows and $AP$ reorders columns. The transpose reverses the permutation: $P^{-1}=P^T$, which need not equal $P$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**置换矩阵**：重排 $I_n$ 的各行得到 $P$：每行每列恰有一个 $1$，其余为零。$PA$ 重排行，$AP$ 重排列；转置撤销重排，$P^{-1}=P^T$，但不必等于 $P$。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000039",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[逆矩阵|Inverse matrix]]\n\nA square matrix has an inverse $B$ when $BA=AB=I$: either composition undoes the original action.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n方阵的双侧逆在两个复合方向都撤销原作用；信息丢失时不存在逆。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000040",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[逆矩阵唯一性|Uniqueness of an inverse]]\n\nIf $B$ and $C$ are two-sided inverses, $B=B(AC)=(BA)C=C$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n结合律把两个候选逆连接起来；矩形矩阵的单侧逆不自动唯一。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000041",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Gauss-Jordan求逆|Gauss–Jordan inversion]]\nFor an $n\\times n$ matrix $A$, apply every row operation to both blocks of $[A\\mid I_n]$. An identity left block makes the right block $A^{-1}$. A different completed left RREF certifies singularity; a zero pivot candidate alone does not.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Gauss-Jordan求逆**：对 $n\\times n$ 方阵 $A$，每次操作同步作用于 $[A\\mid I_n]$ 两块。左块为单位阵时右块为 $A^{-1}$；左块完整 RREF 若不是单位阵，才证实奇异。单个零候选主元不足以判定。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000033",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6660,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[列空间|Column space]]\n$C(A)=\\{Ax:x\\in\\mathbb F^n\\}$ is the span of all columns over the field $\\mathbb F$: every attainable output in $\\mathbb F^m$, not just the listed columns.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**列空间**：$C(A)$ 收集同一数域下各列的全部线性组合，是输出空间中的子空间，并非只含原列。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000035",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8100,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[左零空间|Left nullspace]]\nFor real $A\\in\\mathbb R^{m\\times n}$, $N(A^T)=\\{y:y^TA=0\\}$ contains row-combination weights that cancel and has dimension $m-\\operatorname{rank}(A)$. Every attainable $b$ obeys $y^Tb=0$ for every such $y$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**左零空间**：这些含 $m$ 个坐标的权重把各行抵消为零，维数为 $m-\\operatorname{rank}(A)$。每个可达输出 $b$ 对所有这样的 $y$ 都满足 $y^Tb=0$。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000034",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7620,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[行空间|Row space]]\nFor real $A$, the span of its coefficient rows is $C(A^T)$ when written as columns. It lies on the input side and has dimension $r=\\operatorname{rank}(A)$. The row picture instead draws equation solution sets.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**行空间**：实矩阵各系数行的全部组合形成行空间，按列写为 $C(A^T)$，位于输入侧，维数为 $r=\\operatorname{rank}(A)$。它不同于画方程解集的行图像。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000021",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6660,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵秩|Matrix rank]]\nFor $A\\in\\mathbb F^{m\\times n}$, $r=\\dim C(A)$ counts independent output directions. Full column rank means $r=n$; full row rank means $r=m$. These differ for rectangular matrices.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**矩阵秩**：$r$ 是列空间维数。满列秩 $r=n$ 表示各列无关；满行秩 $r=m$ 表示所有输出都可达，二者不可混同。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000022",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7160,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[零度|Nullity]]\nNullity is $\\dim N(A)$: the number of independent input directions erased by $A$. It counts basis directions, not all solutions or zero entries.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**零度**：零度是零空间的维数，计数独立的零输出方向，不是解的个数或零元素个数。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000023",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6660,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[行秩等于列秩|Row rank equals column rank]]\nFor any $m\\times n$ matrix over a field, the row and column spans have equal dimension $r$. Equal dimensions do not make these two spaces equal.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**行秩等于列秩**：对同一数域上的 $m\\times n$ 矩阵，行空间和列空间的维数同为 $r$。维数相等不意味着两个空间相同。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7380,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[秩零度定理|Rank–nullity]]\nFor a linear map with finite-dimensional domain $V$, kernel dimension plus range dimension equals $\\dim V$. For an $m\\times n$ matrix of rank $r$, nullity is $n-r$. Counting alone specifies no orthogonal split.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**秩零度定理**：有限维输入中，零输出方向数与可达输出方向数之和等于输入维数。这给出零度 $n-r$，本身不指定正交分解。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7950,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[四个基本子空间|Four fundamental subspaces]]\nFor real $m\\times n$ $A$ of rank $r$: row space and nullspace lie in the input space $\\mathbb R^n$, with dimensions $r,n-r$; column space and left nullspace lie in the output space $\\mathbb R^m$, with dimensions $r,m-r$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**四个基本子空间**：实矩阵 $A$ 为 $m\\times n$、秩为 $r$：输入侧是行空间与零空间，维数 $r,n-r$；输出侧是列空间与左零空间，维数 $r,m-r$。环境分别为 $\\mathbb R^n$ 与 $\\mathbb R^m$。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8700,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[基本子空间正交补|Orthogonal-complement pairs]]\nWith the standard real inner product, $N(A)=C(A^T)^\\perp$ and $N(A^T)=C(A)^\\perp$. Taking complements also gives the reverse pairs. Complex Hermitian geometry uses $A^*$, the conjugate transpose.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**基本子空间正交补**：标准实内积下，零空间是行空间的正交补，左零空间是列空间的正交补；反向取补也成立，包含全部垂直方向。复数 Hermitian 几何须用共轭转置 $A^*$。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9040,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[左零空间相容性|Left-nullspace compatibility]]\nFor real $A$, $Ax=b$ is solvable iff $y^Tb=0$ for every $y\\in N(A^T)$. Testing a basis suffices; one failed test proves that no solution exists.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**左零空间相容性**：实矩阵下，$Ax=b$ 有解当且仅当 $b$ 与每个左零向量正交。检查左零空间的一组基就够；一次失败即可证无解，只通过一个方向通常不够。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000043",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8580,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[行操作与四个子空间|Row operations and subspaces]]\nFor real $A$ and invertible $E$, let $R=EA$. Row space and nullspace stay equal as sets, while $C(R)=E\\,C(A)$ and $N(R^T)=E^{-T}N(A^T)$, where $E^{-T}=(E^{-1})^T$. All four dimensions are preserved.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**行操作与四个子空间**：实矩阵满足 $R=EA$、$E$ 可逆时，行空间与零空间作为集合不变；列空间与左零空间按上述公式变换，可能改变但并非必然。四个维数都保持。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "20000000000000a1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8500,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正交|Orthogonality]] → [[正交补|Orthogonal complement]]\n\nZero inner product compares two vectors. A complement collects all vectors perpendicular to the whole subspace, within a fixed ambient space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**从正交到正交补**\n\n先比较两个向量，再固定外部空间、收集垂直于整个子空间的全部向量，才能判断四子空间的配对。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "20000000000000fe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3100,
      "width": 9600,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## 接下来往哪里走\n\n没有精确解时，用 [[正交投影与最小二乘.canvas|正交投影与最小二乘]] 找最接近的可达输出；研究方阵的可逆性与体积变化时进入 [[行列式.canvas|行列式]]；研究同一线性变换在不同坐标中的表示时进入 [[线性变换与换基.canvas|线性变换与换基]]；秩亏系统需要规范解时进入 [[广义逆与最小范数解.canvas|广义逆与最小范数解]]。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1c001aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "## [[方程组的行图像|Row picture · 行图像]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe solution set is the intersection of the equation solution sets.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n解集是各行方程解集的交。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1c001aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "## [[独立约束与自由度|Independent constraints · 独立约束]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAn independent new row removes one degree of freedom from a consistent system.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n对相容系统，新增独立行使解集维数减少一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2c002aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 2210,
      "width": 850,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[固定初值的差分反演|Cumulative sums with an initial value · 固定初值的差分反演]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA known initial value makes cumulative sums recover every original level.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n已知初值后，累加差值可唯一恢复原水平。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2c002aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2590,
      "y": 2470,
      "width": 850,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[非零齐次解与不可逆|Nonzero homogeneous solutions rule out an inverse · 非零齐次解与不可逆]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA nonzero vector mapped to zero reveals lost information and prevents unique recovery.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n非零向量被映到零说明信息丢失，无法唯一恢复输入。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4c004aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 3800,
      "y": 1850,
      "width": 2500,
      "height": 1050,
      "label": "Multiplication rules · 矩阵乘法规则"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4c004aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4700,
      "y": 1970,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵乘法|Matrix multiplication]]\n\nFor $A:m\\times n$ and $B:n\\times p$, $AB:m\\times p$. In $A(Bx)$, $B$ acts first.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n内侧尺寸匹配，逐行乘列求和；复合作用先右后左。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4c004aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": 2520,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵乘法分配律|Distributive laws]]\n\nFor compatible sizes, $A(B+C)=AB+AC$ and $(A+B)C=AC+BC$, preserving factor order.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n尺寸匹配后展开加法；不能交换矩阵因子次序。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4c004aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5450,
      "y": 2520,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[分块矩阵乘法|Block multiplication]]\n\nAlign the inner partition boundaries, then sum compatible block products across the shared block index.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n内部分割边界必须一致；分块后仍沿共同指标求和。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 9900,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2900,
      "height": 2600,
      "label": "Inverse rules and reusable factors · 求逆规则与分解复用"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[乘积的逆矩阵|Inverse of a product]]\n\nFor invertible square matrices $A,B$ of the same size, $(AB)^{-1}=B^{-1}A^{-1}$: undo the last action first.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同阶可逆方阵满足$(AB)^{-1}=B^{-1}A^{-1}$；先撤销最后执行的操作。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[下三角乘积封闭性|Lower triangular products]]\n\nSame-size lower triangular matrices have a lower triangular product. If both have unit diagonals, their product does too.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同尺寸下三角矩阵的乘积仍下三角；两个因子均为单位对角时，乘积也如此。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## [[LDU分解|Separate the pivots]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nExtract nonzero pivots into a diagonal factor.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n把非零主元提取为对角因子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## [[LU分解复用成本|Reuse LU factors]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFactor once in cubic work; solve each new right-hand side in quadratic work.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n分解一次需立方量级，每个新右端需平方量级。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵转置|Matrix transpose]]\n\nAn $m\\times n$ matrix becomes $n\\times m$ by exchanging row and column indices; ordinary transpose does not conjugate.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n交换行列位置和尺寸；普通转置不取复共轭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[乘积的转置|Transpose of a product]]\n\nFor compatible matrices, $(AB)^T=B^TA^T$: reverse the factor order as well as transposing each factor.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n乘积转置必须同时交换因子次序；无需方阵或可逆条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10750,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[转置与求逆可交换|Transpose and inverse]]\n\nFor an invertible square matrix, $(A^T)^{-1}=(A^{-1})^T$. Transposing both inverse identities verifies both sides.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n可逆方阵满足$(A^T)^{-1}=(A^{-1})^T$；转置两条逆恒等式即可验证。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 9900,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 2900,
      "height": 2500,
      "label": "Permutations, symmetry and spaces · 置换、对称与空间"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 3040,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[循环置换的周期|Cycle length and return]]\n\nA single cycle returns after its length, even with extra fixed rows.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n单个循环的周期等于循环长度；额外固定行不改变它。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 3040,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[转置乘积的对称性|Symmetric transpose products]]\n\nFor real $A:m\\times n$, $A^TA$ is symmetric $n\\times n$ and $AA^T$ is symmetric $m\\times m$. Neither is automatically invertible.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实矩阵与自身转置相乘得到对称矩阵，两种次序尺寸可能不同，也不保证可逆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[实反对称矩阵|Real skew-symmetric matrices]]\n\nFor a real square matrix, $A^T=-A$: mirrored entries have opposite signs and every diagonal entry is zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实方阵的转置等于其负矩阵：镜像元素互为相反数，对角元全部为零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[对称矩阵的自由参数|Dimension of the symmetric matrix space]]\n\nFor real symmetric $n\\times n$ matrices, the diagonal and one strict triangle give $n(n+1)/2$ independent coordinates.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实 n 阶对称矩阵的对角线和一个严格三角区域给出 n(n+1)/2 个独立坐标。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 4240,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[反对称矩阵的自由参数|Dimension of the skew-symmetric matrix space]]\n\nFor real skew-symmetric $n\\times n$ matrices, one strict triangle gives $n(n-1)/2$ coordinates; the diagonal is forced to zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实 n 阶反对称矩阵只有一个严格三角区域可自由选择，对角线固定为零，维数为 n(n−1)/2。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 4240,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[转置等式定义的矩阵子空间|Transpose constraints and subspaces]]\n\nFix either $A^T=A$ for the whole family or $A^T=-A$ for the whole family. Transpose linearity preserves that condition under linear combinations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整个矩阵族固定同一种正号或负号转置条件；转置的线性性使线性组合保留该条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 4840,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[低维欧氏空间的子空间|Low-dimensional real subspaces]]\n\nOver the real scalars: $\\{0\\}$, lines through zero, planes through zero where available, and the full ambient space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实数域上：零子空间、过原点的整条直线、维数允许时过原点的整片平面，以及整个环境空间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 4840,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[列图像与列空间|Column picture and column space]]\n\nInterpret one column combination; collect all possible output vectors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n解释列组合的视角；收集所有输出的集合。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c007aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3500,
      "width": 2500,
      "height": 1100,
      "label": "Operations on subspaces · 子空间的集合运算"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c007aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 3630,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[子空间的交集|Intersection of subspaces]]\n\nA vector must satisfy both membership conditions.\n向量必须同时属于两边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c007aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 3630,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[子空间之和|Sum of subspaces]]\n\nAdd one vector from each subspace.\n从两边各取一个向量相加。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c007aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 4100,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[子空间和与并集的张成|The sum is the span of the union]]\n\nClose the union under all linear combinations.\n将并集扩充到对任意线性组合封闭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c007aabbcc0005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 4100,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[纵向拼接的零空间|Nullspace of a vertical stack]]\n\nStacking imposes both homogeneous systems on the same input.\n上下拼接对同一输入同时施加两组齐次约束。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8c008aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 2800,
      "y": 3500,
      "width": 3300,
      "height": 650,
      "label": "Homogeneous solutions and coordinate order · 齐次解与坐标顺序"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8c008aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "[[零空间矩阵|Nullspace matrix]]\n零空间矩阵\n\nCollect a basis as columns; all solutions are x = Nc.\n把基并排组成列，任意系数给出全部齐次解。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8c008aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3980,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "[[列置换后的解向量|Restore coordinates after column permutation]]\n列置换后的解坐标\n\n(AQ)z = b corresponds to Ax = b with x = Qz.\n变量重排后，必须恢复原来的分量标签。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8c008aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5060,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "[[矩阵乘积为零|Zero product and nullspace]]\n零乘积与零空间\n\nAB = 0 iff C(B) is contained in N(A).\n右因子的每个输出，都被左因子映成零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9c009aabbcc0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6600,
      "y": 3500,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "[[全部右端的解集确定矩阵|Equal solution sets for every identical right-hand side]]\n全部右端的解集确定矩阵\n\nHolding each b fixed forces equality of the two matrices.\n对每个固定的 b 要求解集相同，就确定了矩阵。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fac010aabbcc0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8520,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 950,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[按生成向量检验正交|Test a spanning set · 检验生成向量]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nZero dot products with every generator extend to every vector in its span.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n对所有生成向量检验点积为零，即可覆盖整个张成空间。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc011aabbcc0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 4800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[上三角与对称矩阵的交集|Upper triangular and symmetric]]\n\nFor real $n\\times n$ matrices, these two constraints together give exactly the diagonal matrices, a space of dimension $n$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实 n 阶矩阵同时上三角且对称，当且仅当它为对角矩阵；这个空间维数为 n。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc012aabbcc0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 5800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵空间|Matrix space]]\n\nAn entire matrix is one vector.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整个矩阵是一个向量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc012aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 5800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[子空间维数公式|Dimension of a subspace sum]]\n\nCount shared directions once.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n共同方向只计数一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc012aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 5800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵左乘映射的秩与零度|Rank and nullity of left multiplication]]\n\nEach input column can vary freely; matrix-space dimensions count the choices across all columns.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n各输入列可分别自由变化；矩阵空间的维数要合计所有列的自由度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc012aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 6220,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[固定秩矩阵集合|Fixed-rank matrix sets]]\n\nCheck zero and closure under addition.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n检查零矩阵与加法封闭性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc012aabbcc0005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 6220,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[秩分解与秩一展开|Minimal rank-one decomposition]]\n\nRank is the minimum number of rank-one terms; a rank factorization constructs them.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n秩等于秩一展开的最少项数；秩分解提供达到这个数的构造。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0010-direct-sum",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 6220,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[直和|Direct sum]]\n\nEach vector in the sum has a unique decomposition into one component from each subspace; perpendicularity is not required.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n和空间中每个向量的各子空间分量都唯一；不要求垂直。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0012-triangular",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 4800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[三角矩阵|Triangular matrix]]\n\nA square matrix is upper triangular when entries below the diagonal vanish, and lower triangular when those above vanish.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n上三角在主对角线下方全零，下三角在上方全零；对角元允许为零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0012-diagonal",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 4800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[对角矩阵|Diagonal matrix]]\n\nOnly diagonal positions may be nonzero. A square diagonal matrix scales each coordinate separately.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非对角位置全零；对角方阵逐个缩放坐标。矩形扩展须保留尺寸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "u1-close-same-four",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 6660,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[同四空间矩阵的非唯一性|Same four spaces, different maps]]\nEven in fixed coordinates, equal row, column and null spaces do not determine the map. For example, $\\operatorname{diag}(2,3)$ and $I_2$ have the same four spaces but are not scalar multiples.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定坐标下，四个对应子空间完全相同，也不能确定具体作用；对角矩阵 $\\operatorname{diag}(2,3)$ 与 $I_2$ 就有相同四空间，却不是标量倍数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "u1-close-rref-span",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 6660,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[RREF矩阵的张成空间|Span of square RREF matrices]]\nFor positive integer $n$, the span of all real $n\\times n$ RREF matrices is the upper triangular matrix space. We combine whole matrices; the RREF set itself is not a vector space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正整数 $n$ 下，全部实 $n\\times n$ RREF 矩阵张成上三角矩阵空间；这里组合完整矩阵，RREF 集合本身不是向量空间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "u1-close-incidence",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 6660,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[关联矩阵势差映射|Incidence matrix: nodes to edges]]\nFor a finite loopless undirected graph, choose reference edge directions. In $A\\in\\mathbb R^{m\\times n}$, each edge row has $-1$ at its tail and $+1$ at its head. Then $Ax$ gives head-minus-tail node values.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限无向无自环图任选边参考方向；$A$ 每边一行、每节点一列，起点 $-1$、终点 $+1$。$Ax$ 给出终点减起点的节点值差。"
    },
    {
      "id": "u1-close-forest",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 7080,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[关联矩阵与生成森林|Independent edges and spanning forests]]\nWith edges as real incidence rows, independence is equivalent to having no undirected cycle. A maximal independent edge set spans every connected component. If there are $n$ nodes and $c$ components, its $n-c$ rows form a basis of the row space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实关联矩阵每边一行：独立行对应无环边集；极大独立边集才形成覆盖各分量的生成森林。$n$ 个节点、$c$ 个分量时，这 $n-c$ 行构成行空间的一组基。"
    },
    {
      "id": "u1-close-circulation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 7080,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[回路空间与守恒流|Cycle space and conserved flows]]\nWith $-1$ at each tail and $+1$ at each head, $A^Ty$ gives net inflow at every node. Without external injection, signed real flows with no accumulation satisfy $A^Ty=0$. For $m$ edges, $n$ nodes and $c$ components, this space has dimension $m-n+c$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n沿参考方向为正的实流量 $y$，经 $A^T$ 得到各节点净流入；无外部注入且无积累时 $A^Ty=0$。$m$ 条边、$n$ 个节点、$c$ 个分量时，回路空间维数为 $m-n+c$。"
    }
  ],
