      "label": "Once consistent, translate the nullspace · 相容后平移零空间"
    },
    {
      "id": "300000000000000c",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000001",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "2000000000000016",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Apply the rule to each column of B · 对 B 的每列应用同一规则"
    },
    {
      "id": "300000000000000d",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000016",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000029",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Regroup by the shared index into outer products · 按共同中间指标重组为外积和"
    },
    {
      "id": "300000000000000e",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000029",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000017",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Each nonzero outer-product term has rank one · 每个非零外积项的秩为一"
    },
    {
      "id": "300000000000000f",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000031",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "2000000000000042",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Finite products record row equivalence · 有限乘积记录行等价"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000010",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000003",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "2000000000000030",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Synchronized operations preserve solutions · 同步操作保持解集"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000011",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000030",
