      "toNode": "2000000000000015",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "For square LU, record row swaps in PA=LU · 方阵 LU 须用 PA=LU 记录换行"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000012",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000030",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000024",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Normalize pivots and clear above them · 主元归一并清除上方"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000013",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000036",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "2000000000000024",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "Leading entries become ones in cleared columns · 首非零元归一，所在列其余清零"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000014",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000036",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "2000000000000037",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "If consistent, nonpivot unknowns are free · 相容时非主元未知量可任取"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000015",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000004",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000014",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Rank checks basis sizes, not membership · 秩检验基的数量，不能代替成员核验"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000016",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000014",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000025",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Find pivot indices in R, select original columns of A · 在 R 找主元编号，回 A 取原列"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000017",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000014",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000026",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Nonzero RREF rows form the original row-space basis · RREF 非零行构成原行空间基"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000018",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000014",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000027",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Solve Rx=0, activate one free coordinate at a time · 解 Rx=0，逐一激活自由坐标"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000019",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000014",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000028",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Record E in $[A\\mid I_m]\\to[R\\mid E]$ · 保留同步行操作记录 E"
    },
    {
      "id": "300000000000001a",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000033",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "2000000000000014",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "Find pivot indices, then select original columns · 找主元列号，再取原矩阵列"
    },
    {
      "id": "300000000000001b",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000021",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000023",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Column rank equals row rank · 列维数等于行维数"
    },
    {
      "id": "300000000000001c",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000021",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000010",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Rank + nullity counts input dimensions · 秩与零度合计输入维数"
    },
    {
      "id": "300000000000001d",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000022",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000010",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Count erased directions: n minus rank · 零输出方向数为 n 减秩"
    },
    {
      "id": "300000000000001f",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000023",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "2000000000000010",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "On A^T: left nullity m−r · 对 A^T 计数得左零度 m−r"
    },
    {
      "id": "3000000000000020",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000011",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "2000000000000012",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Real standard inner product: complete input/output pairs · 标准实内积下的完整输入/输出配对"
    },
    {
